  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Routes of Enslaved Peoples: Resistance, Liberty and Heritage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme prioritizes activities that deepen understanding of the history and lasting legacies of enslavement and the slave trade. Guided by its strategic framework, it strengthens the production and dissemination of interdisciplinary knowledge; supports the memorialization of this history; promotes methodologies that help communities heal from the trauma of slavery; and advances advocacy on the history and enduring impacts of the slave trade.</narrative>
  </description>
